# Morph Extension Patch: AbyssalCraft
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_acid_spit=Shoggoth Acid Spit: Launches a highly corrosive shoggoth acid projectile forward, melting armor and inflicting continuous acid damage upon impact.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_charge=Dread Charge: Fires an explosive fireball infused with primordial dread, detonating violently and spreading the Dread Plague on impact.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_barrage=Dread Barrage: Rapidly volleys three heavy dread charges forward, devastating enemies across a forward cone.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_dread_slam=Dread Ground Slam: Slams the ground with monstrous force, releasing a shockwave that knocks airborne and infects all surrounding entities with Dread Plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_coralium_squirt=Coralium Ink Squirt: Shoots a virulent coralium ink projectile forward, blinding the target and inflicting Coralium Plague.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_veil=Shadow Veil: Merges seamlessly into the shadows, granting temporary invisibility and greatly enhanced movement speed.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_shadow_collapse=Shadow Collapse: Generates a gravitational void that forcefully drags all nearby entities toward you, inflicting heavy shadow damage and blindness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_anti_implosion=Antimatter Implosion: Triggers a microscopic antimatter annihilation singularity, dealing immense damage and applying severe Antimatter effects to surrounding foes.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ac_jzahar_oblivion=Oblivion Cataclysm: Conjures the destructive gravity of Omothol black holes to crush and obliterate all living beings within radius, inflicting Wither and Levitation curses.
